---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Med Spa SEO Checklist Template | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Operational checklist template for GBP + website alignment, modality clusters, reputation cadence—customize before production use.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Med Spa SEO checklist (template)</h1>
	<p>
		This template distills repeating monthly tasks for owners and agency partners supporting U.S. aesthetic practices:
		entity consistency, modality clusters, credible imagery, humane review solicitation, measurement hygiene.
	</p>
	<h2>Quarterly foundation</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Audit category + modeled services versus licensed scope.</li>
		<li>NAP symmetry across GBP, FB/IG placeholders, Yelp (if operated), Bing Places, Apple Maps.</li>
		<li>Validate booking links—not just presence but mobile completion flows.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Monthly review</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Select one flagship modality page—refresh FAQs, clinician proof, intra-site links.</li>
		<li>Upload at least three net-new visuals with documented consent.</li>
		<li>Scan review thematic tags; debrief coordinators on recurring mis-set expectations.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<strong>Customization:</strong>
		swap rows for your compliance matrix; never treat this artifact as HIPAA legal advice.
	</p>
</PageShell>
